# WS3 database migrations

This directory contains the single active baseline migration for the supported
MES scope. New schema changes must be added as immutable Alembic revisions;
never edit a revision that has already been applied to a shared database.

For a fresh database:

```powershell
uv run --project backend alembic -c backend\alembic.ini upgrade head
```

The migration history before `20261118_0001` is preserved on the
`archive/pre-baseline-alembic` branch and is not part of the active `main`
installation path. Existing databases should follow the backup/export/import
procedure documented in `docs/deployment/alembic-safety.md`.
